'=====================================================================
' Agent name : BulkReg\07 - AutoSync
' Version    : 4.0.1  (BulkReg release; libraries BulkRegCommon + BulkRegAgents + BulkRegAuto 4.0.1)
' Code       : ALL logic is in the script library BulkRegAuto (BA_RunAutoSync).
'              This agent only calls it, so it never changes between releases.
'
' HOW TO INSTALL (on the SERVER copy of the database, e.g. bulkreg_auto.nsf - NOT the
'              local bulkreg.nsf of the workstation): open the agent, click in the editor,
'              Ctrl+A, Delete, paste this WHOLE file, Ctrl+S.
' Designer   : Shared agent, LotusScript
'              Runtime: On schedule  >  More frequently than daily  >  every 60 minutes
'                       (or "Daily" for a nightly run; first runs: 1 hour is a good start)
'              Run on : ONE named server - the one that holds the Domino Directory master
'                       (never "Any server": two servers would run it at the same time)
'              Target : None
'              Security (Agent properties): "Run on behalf of" EMPTY, unless your Domino
'                       security design needs it; then set AutoExpectedUser in bulkreg_auto.ini
'              Sign   : with the dedicated service administrator ID that is listed in the
'                       Server document under "Run unrestricted methods and operations" and is
'                       a Registration Authority of the CA (docs/AUTOSYNC.md, steps S2-S4)
' (backslash in the name = Actions > BulkReg submenu; do NOT use '|')
'
' What it does (details: BulkRegAuto > BA_RunAutoSync):
'
' New users that DirSync wrote from Active Directory into the Domino Directory are
' registered automatically, with the SAME code as agents 02 (build) and 03 (register) and
' the SAME configuration keys (home server pool, mail files, policy, vault, replicas), and
' verified afterwards with the code of agent 04. The reviewed-batch step of the manual
' process is replaced by safety gates:
'   - AutoMode OFF / SHADOW (simulate) / LIVE; AutoInitialLoadDone must be 1
'   - STOP file, single-instance lock, run-as identity, environment check, self-pause
'   - settling time before a new user is taken (AutoMinAgeMinutes), per-run cap
'     (AutoMaxUsersPerRun), backlog and error-ratio gates, backoff + quarantine per user
'   - run-time budget, circuit breaker, wrong-Notes-name stop (from agent 03)
'   - follow-up verification until vault, mail file, ACL and all replicas are OK
'   - Domino mail summary + Run/Audit documents in bulkreg_log.nsf
'
' Config  : bulkreg_auto.ini; its path is the notes.ini variable BulkRegAutoConfig
'           (Linux default /local/notesdata/bulkreg/config/bulkreg_auto.ini)
' Output  : the usual run folder (RUN_INFO.txt, audit CSV, debug log) under AuditDir, batch and
'           results files under BatchDir, state under AutoStateDir.
'=====================================================================
'#####################################################################
' --- part 1: (Options) ---
'#####################################################################
Option Public
Option Declare
Use "BulkRegAuto"
'#####################################################################
' --- part 2: Initialize ---
'#####################################################################
Sub Initialize
	Call BA_RunAutoSync()
End Sub
